1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:04,100
A new rival appears before Tsubasa.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,380
His name is Nitta Shun!

3
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:08,040
This immensely strong player...

4
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:13,570
...surprises even Tsubasa with his unique powerful Hawk Shot.

5
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:18,950
However, the Nankatsu players continue their practice comfortably.

6
00:00:18,950 --> 00:00:23,920
Tsubasa draws attention to the situation and motivates them to work harder.

7
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,580
Alright! Let's do this!

8
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:29,130
With the same feeling awakening in Ishizaki, Kisugi, and the others...

9
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:32,670
...Nankatsu Middle School unites.

10
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:36,020
On the other hand, Otomo Middle School, where Urabe is...

11
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:38,680
...continues preparations to overthrow former champion Tsubasa.

12
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:40,740
And also....

13
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:46,560
...the Shizuoka Regional Tournament, which will grant a ticket to the National Middle School Football Tournament, begins.

14
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:51,010
Nankatsu Middle School, aiming to become the first in history to win consecutive championships, and...

15
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:53,320
...Otomo Middle School from the same region are highly ambitious.

16
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:55,820
Both are determined to show their strength...

17
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:58,320
...and prove it by winning every match.

18
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:58,320
Otomo Middle School

19
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:00,120
Hawk...

20
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:02,000
...Shot!

21
00:01:07,250 --> 00:01:08,250
That's it!

22
00:01:08,250 --> 00:01:10,250
He did it!

23
00:01:08,250 --> 00:01:12,760
Semi-Final
Otomo Middle School: 5
Kawazuichi Middle School: 0

24
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:12,760
While Otomo Middle School is the first team to advance from the groups to the final...

25
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:14,510
...Nankatsu is following them.

26
00:01:14,510 --> 00:01:15,430
Here!

27
00:01:16,100 --> 00:01:16,590
Taki!

28
00:01:17,960 --> 00:01:18,470
Kisugi!

29
00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:24,890
They defeat Okabe Middle School 5-1 in the semi-finals and advance to the final.

30
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:24,890
Semi-Final
Nankatsu Middle School: 5
Okabe Middle School: 1

31
00:01:25,910 --> 00:01:27,490
That's to be expected from Nankatsu.

32
00:01:27,490 --> 00:01:30,360
They have great movement and no gaps in their formation.

33
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:34,260
With Tsubasa as the ace, Izawa, Taki, and Kisugi are on the attack.

34
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:38,000
On defense, there's Morisaki, Takasugi, and Ishizaki.

35
00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:43,580
Although they seem like a great team, they actually revolve solely around Tsubasa.

36
00:01:43,580 --> 00:01:48,580
Attack and defense depend only on Tsubasa getting the ball and passing to them.

37
00:01:48,580 --> 00:01:52,590
Therefore, as long as we mark Tsubasa, we can win!

38
00:01:52,590 --> 00:01:54,460
Exactly.

39
00:01:55,340 --> 00:02:00,450
However, marking only Tsubasa is the hardest thing.

40
00:02:00,450 --> 00:02:01,400
You...

41
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,890
Hyuga Kojiro!

42
00:02:02,890 --> 00:02:09,900
Thanks to him, as the runner-up for the past two years, he made me realize this very well.

43
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:12,520
But this year will be different.

44
00:02:13,170 --> 00:02:18,050
This year, as a team, Toho Academy is definitely better than Nankatsu!

45
00:02:18,050 --> 00:02:21,530
In football, the stronger team wins.

46
00:02:21,530 --> 00:02:25,500
I will prove that by becoming champion this year.

47
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:26,760
Is that so?

48
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:30,960
But we, as Otomo, will beat Nankatsu first!

49
00:02:32,290 --> 00:02:33,830
That's impossible!

50
00:02:33,830 --> 00:02:39,200
I've seen your play. Beating Nankatsu is a very distant dream for you!

51
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:39,970
What did you say?!

52
00:02:39,970 --> 00:02:41,810
Hyuga-san.

53
00:02:41,810 --> 00:02:45,380
At least say that after becoming a national champion once.

54
00:02:45,380 --> 00:02:46,470
What?!

55
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:49,870
Like I said. I achieved that.

56
00:02:49,870 --> 00:02:56,030
I became Japan's number one by beating your one and only student, Sawada Takeshi.

57
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:58,190
I'm Nitta Shun!

58
00:02:58,190 --> 00:02:59,740
Get that well into your head!

59
00:03:04,270 --> 00:03:06,980
Ai! Ai! Ai!

60
00:03:04,270 --> 00:03:06,980
Love! Love! Love!

61
00:03:07,900 --> 00:03:10,570
Ai! Ai! Ai!

62
00:03:07,900 --> 00:03:10,570
Love! Love! Love!

63
00:03:11,490 --> 00:03:14,200
Ai! Ai! Ai!

64
00:03:11,490 --> 00:03:14,200
Love! Love! Love!

65
00:03:21,070 --> 00:03:23,920
moeru you ni hitori demo

66
00:03:21,070 --> 00:03:23,920
Even if I burn alone

67
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:30,170
ikiteyukeru to usobuite hashiritsudzukete

68
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:30,170
I keep running while lying to myself that I can live alone

69
00:03:30,170 --> 00:03:36,050
unobore no morosa wo kimi wa shitteta na no ni

70
00:03:30,170 --> 00:03:36,050
You knew how fragile my arrogance makes me

71
00:03:36,050 --> 00:03:42,640
kokoro made uchinomaresareta kono yoru ni

72
00:03:36,050 --> 00:03:42,640
In this night that even shatters my heart

73
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:46,650
kimi no koe sagasu

74
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:46,650
Searching for your voice

75
00:03:46,650 --> 00:03:51,150
kono yowasa ga nikui yo

76
00:03:46,650 --> 00:03:51,150
I hate how weak I am

77
00:03:51,150 --> 00:03:56,700
ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya

78
00:03:51,150 --> 00:03:56,700
I have to go get you back right now

79
00:03:56,700 --> 00:03:58,280
baka darou?

80
00:03:56,700 --> 00:03:58,280
Aren't I a fool?

81
00:03:58,280 --> 00:03:59,490
ai

82
00:03:58,280 --> 00:03:59,490
Love!

83
00:03:59,490 --> 00:04:03,120
kizudarake no ai wo shinjite

84
00:03:59,490 --> 00:04:03,120
Believing in my love full of wounds

85
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:12,880
nagareochita namida sae mo tsuyosa e to kaete

86
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:12,880
I'll turn even the tears I've shed into strength

87
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:13,720
ai

88
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:13,720
Love!

89
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:17,510
kizudarake no ai da to shite mo

90
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:17,510
Even if it's a love full of wounds

91
00:04:17,510 --> 00:04:21,520
bokura no sekai wo tomoshiteru

92
00:04:17,510 --> 00:04:21,520
It illuminates our world

93
00:04:21,520 --> 00:04:27,770
kono ai mo ichido taritomo

94
00:04:21,520 --> 00:04:27,770
Not even for a moment will this love

95
00:04:27,770 --> 00:04:30,560
hanasanai

96
00:04:27,770 --> 00:04:30,560
I won't let it fade

97
00:04:32,250 --> 00:04:37,250
Episode 30:
Regional Tournament Finals! The Hawk Shot!

98
00:04:32,250 --> 00:04:37,250
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

99
00:04:37,850 --> 00:04:39,920
Good morning!

100
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,670
Good morning, Kumi-chan!

101
00:04:41,670 --> 00:04:45,640
Nakazawa-senpai, it's almost time for the final.

102
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:47,680
If we win, we'll go to the nationals.

103
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:50,680
I'll cheer with all my heart today!

104
00:04:51,270 --> 00:04:52,900
What's this?

105
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:56,810
I sliced lemons and put them in honey.

106
00:04:56,810 --> 00:04:59,090
I thought it would be nice for them to eat during halftime.

107
00:04:59,090 --> 00:05:00,980
For Tsubasa-senpai?

108
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:02,940
F-For everyone...

109
00:05:02,940 --> 00:05:04,500
That's to be expected from you, Senpai!

110
00:05:04,500 --> 00:05:06,380
It's really hot outside.

111
00:05:06,380 --> 00:05:09,600
When he comes exhausted, you'll feed Tsubasa-senpai with lemons.

112
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:11,480
The fatigue of the first half will disappear!

113
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:13,500
"Yes! Keep it up in the second half!"

114
00:05:14,250 --> 00:05:15,500
"Shoot!"

115
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:16,660
"Goal!"

116
00:05:16,660 --> 00:05:17,780
What are you doing?

117
00:05:19,740 --> 00:05:21,080
Come on, let's go.

118
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:22,710
Okay...

119
00:05:22,710 --> 00:05:26,220
The Shizuoka Regional Tournament Final is about to begin.

120
00:05:26,220 --> 00:05:32,270
With the stadium packed to the brim, the sides are engaged in a cheering contest!

121
00:05:30,670 --> 00:05:33,210
Otomo Middle School, push!

122
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:39,110
Finally, we'll see Ozora Tsubasa.

123
00:05:39,110 --> 00:05:42,150
Yes, finally.

124
00:05:42,780 --> 00:05:44,400
Listen, everyone.

125
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:49,660
We've come comfortably so far, but Otomo Middle School will be a bit different.

126
00:05:49,660 --> 00:05:52,600
I want you to be more careful than usual.

127
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,490
Okay!

128
00:05:53,490 --> 00:05:55,430
Coach.

129
00:05:55,430 --> 00:05:56,660
What is it, Tsubasa?

130
00:05:56,660 --> 00:06:02,000
Today, will you let me play defense in the first half and mark Nitta?

131
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,720
Mark Nitta?

132
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,520
Yes.

133
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:07,240
While Urabe and the others tightly protect the goal on Otomo's team...

134
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:10,050
...they counter-attack with Nitta.

135
00:06:10,050 --> 00:06:13,430
If I play attack-oriented as usual...

136
00:06:13,430 --> 00:06:17,850
...Nitta will be left free, just as they want.

137
00:06:17,850 --> 00:06:22,610
Besides, Nitta is quite serious about challenging me.

138
00:06:22,610 --> 00:06:25,400
I want to accept it and face him!

139
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,990
I understand. Let's implement Tsubasa's plan.

140
00:06:28,990 --> 00:06:30,720
Everyone, is that okay with you?

141
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,820
Yes!

142
00:06:32,330 --> 00:06:37,040
This year, we've worked hard to overthrow the former champion Nankatsu!

143
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:41,700
And today, the time has finally come to achieve this goal!

144
00:06:41,700 --> 00:06:42,940
Listen, everyone.

145
00:06:42,940 --> 00:06:46,170
With our current form, we can definitely beat Nankatsu!

146
00:06:46,170 --> 00:06:50,500
This year, by beating Nankatsu, we will participate in the National Tournament!

147
00:06:50,500 --> 00:06:51,300
Yes!

148
00:06:53,540 --> 00:06:56,640
Both teams are entering the field.

149
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:59,120
We've always aimed for the same thing until now.

150
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:01,060
This match will be a duel.

151
00:07:01,060 --> 00:07:03,520
The sides are very excited!

152
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:06,360
Otomo Middle School! Crush Nankatsu this year!

153
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:10,150
Both teams have been fielding their best players since the first match.

154
00:07:10,150 --> 00:07:14,260
Will Nankatsu or Otomo win the regional tournament and go to the National Tournament?

155
00:07:14,260 --> 00:07:17,180
Both teams have been very ambitious from the start.

156
00:07:17,180 --> 00:07:19,120
We're very excited about the result!

157
00:07:19,700 --> 00:07:24,340
As you know, the ace players of both teams...

158
00:07:24,340 --> 00:07:28,880
...were teammates at Nankatsu during elementary school.

159
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:32,890
Moreover, Nitta-kun from Otomo, after Tsubasa-kun...

160
00:07:32,890 --> 00:07:40,140
...became the National Youth Football Tournament champion as Nankatsu SC Captain together with Goalkeeper Ichijo-kun.

161
00:07:40,140 --> 00:07:43,270
This match can be called a destined encounter.

162
00:07:43,270 --> 00:07:46,020
Will the undefeated Nankatsu win?

163
00:07:46,020 --> 00:07:48,150
Or will the new Otomo win?

164
00:07:50,110 --> 00:07:53,450
The Shizuoka Regional Tournament began with the kick-off.

165
00:07:53,450 --> 00:07:56,450
Kisugi-kun and Izawa-kun advance into the opponent's half.

166
00:07:56,450 --> 00:07:59,540
Will playmaker Tsubasa-kun also come?

167
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:01,490
No, he's not moving.

168
00:08:01,490 --> 00:08:04,290
Tsubasa-kun continues to stay back.

169
00:08:04,290 --> 00:08:05,130
What?!

170
00:08:05,130 --> 00:08:06,420
What does this mean?

171
00:08:06,420 --> 00:08:08,300
Tsubasa won't attack?!

172
00:08:08,300 --> 00:08:11,920
Even if Tsubasa doesn't come, we're enough for you!

173
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:13,050
What did you say?

174
00:08:14,050 --> 00:08:14,720
Let's go!

175
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:15,690
Yes!

176
00:08:15,690 --> 00:08:19,220
Nankatsu attacks with Kisugi-kun, Taki-kun, and Izawa-kun!

177
00:08:19,220 --> 00:08:20,470
Don't underestimate us!

178
00:08:21,270 --> 00:08:22,700
Exactly.

179
00:08:22,700 --> 00:08:26,520
The reason we're so fixated on beating Nankatsu...

180
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:28,760
...was you.

181
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:34,450
No matter how you look at it, we were in the background when we were at Nankatsu SC.

182
00:08:34,450 --> 00:08:40,290
And you were selected as the most valuable players in the Youth Football Tournament.

183
00:08:40,290 --> 00:08:44,540
Exactly! I used my inferiority complex to get stronger for years!

184
00:08:44,540 --> 00:08:46,920
We'll make you feel the same things!

185
00:08:46,920 --> 00:08:48,420
We will be the winners!

186
00:08:48,420 --> 00:08:50,050
Here we come, Nankatsu!

187
00:08:50,050 --> 00:08:52,130
Do you think we'll allow it?!

188
00:08:52,130 --> 00:08:53,670
Taki!

189
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:58,720
Otomo Middle School gets the ball!

190
00:08:58,720 --> 00:08:59,970
What?!

191
00:08:59,970 --> 00:09:02,050
Building a wall on Otomo's defense...

192
00:09:02,060 --> 00:09:05,560
...Urabe-kun, Nishio-kun, Kishida-kun, and Nakayama-kun form the Otomo Quartet!

193
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:07,620
They have amazing moves!

194
00:09:07,620 --> 00:09:09,820
When did they get this strong?

195
00:09:09,820 --> 00:09:11,300
We'll stop them!

196
00:09:11,300 --> 00:09:12,320
Yes!

197
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,740
Think again!

198
00:09:15,110 --> 00:09:17,280
Otomo Middle School passes!

199
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:21,290
The pass comes directly to center forward Nitta-kun!

200
00:09:21,290 --> 00:09:22,950
Nice pass, Senpai!

201
00:09:22,950 --> 00:09:24,080
I won't allow it!

202
00:09:26,170 --> 00:09:27,210
What?!

203
00:09:27,210 --> 00:09:32,840
With his speed of running 100 meters in 11 seconds, Nitta-kun advances towards the goal!

204
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:35,590
Alright! Let's start with one goal!

205
00:09:35,590 --> 00:09:38,590
However, Nankatsu Captain Tsubasa-kun comes to mark him!

206
00:09:38,590 --> 00:09:41,600
Is this why Tsubasa stayed back?!

207
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,760
So you've come!

208
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:45,100
I've been waiting for this moment!

209
00:09:45,100 --> 00:09:46,590
Come, Nitta.

210
00:09:46,590 --> 00:09:48,850
I will accept your challenge.

211
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:03,870
An early confrontation!

212
00:10:08,660 --> 00:10:11,750
The ball remains with the more experienced Tsubasa-kun!

213
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:13,300
D-Damn it!

214
00:10:13,300 --> 00:10:15,340
Alright, now let's attack!

215
00:10:15,340 --> 00:10:17,340
Damn Ozora Tsubasa!

216
00:10:17,340 --> 00:10:19,340
Our real fight will start now!

217
00:10:19,340 --> 00:10:21,340
That's to be expected from Ozora Tsubasa.

218
00:10:21,340 --> 00:10:23,140
Nice moves.

219
00:10:23,140 --> 00:10:24,350
Exactly.

220
00:10:24,350 --> 00:10:25,520
Come, Tsubasa!

221
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:28,020
If you don't come to me, it won't be any fun!

222
00:10:28,020 --> 00:10:31,810
Tsubasa-kun, the Otomo Quartet awaits!

223
00:10:31,810 --> 00:10:36,840
We dedicated last year to beating Nankatsu, to beating Tsubasa!

224
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:39,820
To catch up to Tsubasa's speed...

225
00:10:39,820 --> 00:10:42,700
To withstand Tsubasa's dribbles...

226
00:10:42,700 --> 00:10:45,700
...we trained continuously for a year!

227
00:10:45,700 --> 00:10:48,260
Even if we're not as talented as you in football...

228
00:10:48,260 --> 00:10:51,210
...we won't lose to you in effort and hard work!

229
00:10:51,210 --> 00:10:54,300
We'll show you the fruits of our training, Tsubasa!

230
00:10:54,300 --> 00:10:56,090
Get past us if you can!

231
00:10:56,090 --> 00:10:57,780
This time, I will pass.

232
00:10:57,780 --> 00:10:59,510
I'll return what you've done.

233
00:11:00,110 --> 00:11:02,850
This is a head-to-head battle!

234
00:11:06,980 --> 00:11:07,600
Got it!

235
00:11:09,140 --> 00:11:12,520
Tsubasa-kun trips and loses his balance!

236
00:11:12,520 --> 00:11:13,560
Tsubasa!

237
00:11:16,140 --> 00:11:17,110
Tsubasa?

238
00:11:17,110 --> 00:11:19,850
What happened? What was that move?

239
00:11:19,850 --> 00:11:22,200
Their opponents are quite good too.

240
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:22,870
What?

241
00:11:22,870 --> 00:11:29,120
If Tsubasa had tried to pass that quartet, he would have definitely lost the ball.

242
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:31,440
What sharp reflexes.

243
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:34,790
They closed off all the paths I could dribble through.

244
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:36,380
This was to be expected.

245
00:11:36,380 --> 00:11:40,640
You noticed our moves and immediately made a back pass.

246
00:11:40,640 --> 00:11:42,670
Alright! This time to Ishizaki!

247
00:11:42,670 --> 00:11:43,800
Yes!

248
00:11:43,310 --> 00:11:43,800
What?!

249
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:45,800
If Tsubasa can't do it, it's impossible for me!

250
00:11:46,930 --> 00:11:48,760
Tsubasa is falling back!

251
00:11:48,760 --> 00:11:49,850
Here's the chance!

252
00:11:51,420 --> 00:11:52,060
Oda!

253
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:55,940
Takasugi!

254
00:11:56,560 --> 00:12:01,070
Last year's champion Nankatsu, despite holding the ball, is retreating on the field.

255
00:12:01,070 --> 00:12:02,180
Did you see?!

256
00:12:02,180 --> 00:12:05,320
If we beat Tsubasa, this is the caliber of Nankatsu!

257
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,800
D-Damn it...

258
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:09,080
Everyone! Don't leave the game's flow to them!

259
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:10,930
Get the ball to Tsubasa!

260
00:12:10,930 --> 00:12:12,000
Y-Yes.

261
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:14,330
Nankatsu delivers the ball to Tsubasa-kun.

262
00:12:15,560 --> 00:12:18,540
Will they make a counter-attack directed by Tsubasa-kun?

263
00:12:18,540 --> 00:12:19,670
Come, Tsubasa!

264
00:12:19,670 --> 00:12:20,460
Izawa!

265
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:23,130
A pass that barely escapes being offside!

266
00:12:23,130 --> 00:12:24,390
I won't allow it!

267
00:12:24,390 --> 00:12:27,430
However, Nakayama-kun from Otomo seems about to intercept the pass.

268
00:12:28,160 --> 00:12:28,850
What?!

269
00:12:28,890 --> 00:12:32,140
What?! The ball changes direction in the air!

270
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:33,640
Go!

271
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:36,400
Realizing that Nakayama-kun would intercept the pass, Tsubasa-kun...

272
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:38,770
...sent the ball with a slight curve.

273
00:12:38,770 --> 00:12:40,270
You did it, Tsubasa!

274
00:12:40,270 --> 00:12:41,780
Damn Nakayama...

275
00:12:41,780 --> 00:12:44,360
This is what happens when you underestimate Tsubasa.

276
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:48,200
After receiving the pass, Izawa-kun is free and shoots!

277
00:12:49,870 --> 00:12:51,330
Alright, goal!

278
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,440
He caught it!

279
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:57,840
Otomo goalkeeper Ichijo-kun dives and catches it!

280
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:59,460
N-No way...

281
00:13:02,460 --> 00:13:06,890
We've made it to the finals. Finally, it's my time to shine.

282
00:13:10,030 --> 00:13:15,020
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

283
00:13:15,020 --> 00:13:20,230
Goalkeeper Ichijo-kun saves Otomo from a difficult situation with a wonderful catch!

284
00:13:20,230 --> 00:13:21,570
Very nice, Ichijo.

285
00:13:21,570 --> 00:13:23,870
He caught the shot that came from there.

286
00:13:23,870 --> 00:13:29,030
In this tournament, all of Izawa's shots when he was free had resulted in goals.

287
00:13:29,030 --> 00:13:30,500
It was so close!

288
00:13:30,500 --> 00:13:32,810
I was sure it was a goal!

289
00:13:32,810 --> 00:13:35,770
It seems the opponent's goalkeeper is also very good.

290
00:13:35,770 --> 00:13:39,000
Nankatsu could lose this match.

291
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:42,550
Hold on! What do you mean Nankatsu could lose?

292
00:13:42,550 --> 00:13:44,300
Hiroshi-kun!

293
00:13:45,130 --> 00:13:46,340
Yukari!

294
00:13:46,340 --> 00:13:48,380
It really is you, Hiroshi-kun.

295
00:13:48,380 --> 00:13:49,920
What are you doing here?

296
00:13:49,920 --> 00:13:51,350
What am I doing?

297
00:13:51,350 --> 00:13:54,000
I came to watch the Nankatsu match.

298
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,580
Yukari, what are you doing here?

299
00:13:56,580 --> 00:13:59,770
I'm the manager of the Nankatsu Middle School Football Club.

300
00:13:59,770 --> 00:14:02,910
Yukari-senpai, do you know each other?

301
00:14:02,910 --> 00:14:04,650
Let me introduce you.

302
00:14:04,650 --> 00:14:08,340
My cousin Jito Hiroshi-kun, a football player in Kyushu.

303
00:14:08,340 --> 00:14:09,320
Yes.

304
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:12,380
So, what do you mean Nankatsu could lose?

305
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:14,830
Just as I said.

306
00:14:14,830 --> 00:14:18,240
We came to see Nankatsu's strength, but...

307
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:22,290
...their opponent Otomo Middle School also looks quite strong.

308
00:14:22,970 --> 00:14:25,340
That quartet Tsubasa couldn't pass.

309
00:14:25,340 --> 00:14:30,590
Also, the goalkeeper who stopped that shot which would have been a goal in another situation.

310
00:14:30,590 --> 00:14:34,640
They aren't very flashy, but their skills are quite good.

311
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:38,810
And especially, number 9 catches my interest.

312
00:14:38,810 --> 00:14:39,850
Exactly.

313
00:14:40,940 --> 00:14:43,960
Even though he lost the ball in his duel with Tsubasa...

314
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:46,070
...it was a very close struggle.

315
00:14:46,070 --> 00:14:49,230
I'm sure Tsubasa is also aware of his talent.

316
00:14:49,230 --> 00:14:51,030
He's marking him himself today.

317
00:14:51,030 --> 00:14:53,820
And who are you?

318
00:14:53,820 --> 00:14:57,750
Katagiri from the Japan National Football Federation.

319
00:14:57,750 --> 00:15:03,930
And you are Jito Hiroshi-kun from Hirado Middle School, the Nagasaki regional representative.

320
00:15:04,710 --> 00:15:08,280
In this match where both teams focus on defense...

321
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:10,390
...I don't expect many goals.

322
00:15:10,390 --> 00:15:13,600
So the first goal will be very effective.

323
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:16,360
As for Otomo Middle School's goalkeeper, from what I see...

324
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:19,390
...Tsubasa needs to shoot and score.

325
00:15:19,390 --> 00:15:21,910
But if Tsubasa goes on the attack...

326
00:15:21,910 --> 00:15:24,150
...number 9 will be left free.

327
00:15:24,150 --> 00:15:31,120
In this situation, Otomo holds the advantage with more balance in attack and defense.

328
00:15:31,910 --> 00:15:39,330
This match is between Tsubasa and the advantaged number 9 Nitta Shun of the Otomo team.

329
00:15:39,330 --> 00:15:42,540
Once again, Nitta-kun receives the pass!

330
00:15:42,540 --> 00:15:46,330
But Nankatsu Captain Tsubasa-kun comes to mark him!

331
00:15:46,330 --> 00:15:48,380
Come, Tsubasa-senpai!

332
00:15:48,830 --> 00:15:53,380
I may not have been able to get past you with strength...

333
00:15:53,380 --> 00:15:55,850
...but there are other ways!

334
00:15:56,620 --> 00:15:57,260
What?!

335
00:15:57,260 --> 00:16:00,880
Take this! Hawk Shot!

336
00:16:01,940 --> 00:16:05,560
Nitta-kun fires a powerful shot!

337
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:10,780
The ball passes Tsubasa-kun and heads towards the goal!

338
00:16:10,780 --> 00:16:11,530
Morisaki!

339
00:16:11,530 --> 00:16:12,110
Damn it!

340
00:16:13,030 --> 00:16:14,100
That's it! We did it!

341
00:16:14,100 --> 00:16:15,700
You did it, Nitta!

342
00:16:16,450 --> 00:16:17,990
It's missing!

343
00:16:18,460 --> 00:16:22,120
The ball skims past!

344
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:23,100
Damn it!

345
00:16:23,100 --> 00:16:25,130
Just 20 centimeters!

346
00:16:26,630 --> 00:16:28,150
Oh man, oh man...

347
00:16:28,150 --> 00:16:28,900
Yes...

348
00:16:28,900 --> 00:16:31,920
Tsubasa!

349
00:16:32,930 --> 00:16:35,550
I'd expect that from you, Tsubasa-senpai.

350
00:16:35,550 --> 00:16:38,010
If you had flinched from the shot I took...

351
00:16:38,010 --> 00:16:40,330
...it would have been a goal.

352
00:16:40,330 --> 00:16:46,400
By letting it graze slightly, you prevented the ball from going into the goal.

353
00:16:47,610 --> 00:16:48,610
What?!

354
00:16:49,560 --> 00:16:51,360
You're good, Nitta.

355
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:52,880
I'm happy.

356
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:57,100
After a long time, I've met someone who excites me again.

357
00:16:57,100 --> 00:16:58,700
Are you okay, Tsubasa?!

358
00:16:58,700 --> 00:17:00,440
Coach, the first aid kit!

359
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:01,700
O-Okay!

360
00:17:02,650 --> 00:17:05,160
The referee calls for a break.

361
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:07,960
Both teams can have something to drink.

362
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:09,960
Does he have no rival?

363
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:10,840
Yes.

364
00:17:11,440 --> 00:17:14,520
Japan is too small for Tsubasa.

365
00:17:14,520 --> 00:17:19,680
There may no longer be anyone in this country who can be a rival to Tsubasa.

366
00:17:20,220 --> 00:17:25,190
Hyuga Kojiro and Wakashimazu Ken from Toho Academy.

367
00:17:25,190 --> 00:17:28,040
Misugi Jun from Musashi Middle School.

368
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:30,750
Matsuyama Hikaru from Furano Middle School.

369
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:33,620
The Tachibana Brothers from Hanawa Middle School.

370
00:17:33,620 --> 00:17:37,660
They were all once considered his rivals.

371
00:17:37,660 --> 00:17:41,110
But after the 2 years during middle school...

372
00:17:41,110 --> 00:17:44,660
...unfortunately, none of them can match Tsubasa anymore.

373
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:50,170
Right now, Tsubasa is already playing far above the high school level.

374
00:17:50,170 --> 00:17:57,380
But he has now met someone named Nitta whose power hasn't been fully refined yet.

375
00:17:57,380 --> 00:18:00,930
The person enjoying this the most right now is Tsubasa.

376
00:18:00,930 --> 00:18:04,350
As the person standing at the top of middle school football, Tsubasa...

377
00:18:04,350 --> 00:18:07,390
...needs a large number of stronger rivals.

378
00:18:07,390 --> 00:18:14,530
In this respect, Jito-kun, you could become Tsubasa's new rival.

379
00:18:14,530 --> 00:18:16,200
Of course I will!

380
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:19,990
The one who will prevent Nankatsu's 3rd victory is me!

381
00:18:19,990 --> 00:18:22,960
Hiroshi, since when have you become that good at football?

382
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:24,750
Yukari!

383
00:18:24,750 --> 00:18:26,910
The cooling break is over.

384
00:18:26,910 --> 00:18:28,960
Both teams are returning to the field.

385
00:18:30,070 --> 00:18:35,010
After the ball grazed the goal due to Tsubasa-kun's touch...

386
00:18:35,010 --> 00:18:37,510
...the game will continue with Otomo Middle School taking a corner kick.

387
00:18:37,510 --> 00:18:40,390
Otomo Captain Urabe-kun will take the corner.

388
00:18:40,390 --> 00:18:42,700
Will he send it to star player Nitta-kun?

389
00:18:42,700 --> 00:18:44,810
But Tsubasa-kun has him tightly marked.

390
00:18:46,670 --> 00:18:47,980
The ball comes high!

391
00:18:49,450 --> 00:18:53,020
This is for Nakayama-kun at the back!

392
00:18:53,020 --> 00:18:54,150
Morisaki, jump!

393
00:18:54,150 --> 00:18:55,190
Okay!

394
00:18:55,750 --> 00:18:59,160
But Nankatsu goalkeeper Morisaki-kun catches it tightly!

395
00:18:59,160 --> 00:18:59,820
Damn it!

396
00:18:59,820 --> 00:19:00,700
Send it!

397
00:19:01,260 --> 00:19:03,410
Now it's Nankatsu's turn to attack!

398
00:19:04,110 --> 00:19:06,120
Izawa-kun receives the pass.

399
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:09,660
But Otomo steals the ball right away.

400
00:19:09,660 --> 00:19:10,420
Urabe!

401
00:19:11,590 --> 00:19:15,500
Otomo Middle School quickly cuts off Nankatsu's attacks where Tsubasa-kun isn't participating!

402
00:19:15,500 --> 00:19:20,470
However, with their star player Nitta-kun under marking, they also can't find the goal!

403
00:19:20,470 --> 00:19:24,130
The Shizuoka Regional Tournament final is still 0-0!

404
00:19:24,130 --> 00:19:27,560
It's literally a fierce match decided by a single goal!

405
00:19:27,560 --> 00:19:32,430
As you said, the first goal will have a big impact.

406
00:19:32,430 --> 00:19:33,190
Yes.

407
00:19:33,190 --> 00:19:36,320
And as I thought, the person who will score that goal...

408
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:39,940
With less than a minute left in the first half, Nankatsu is attacking!

409
00:19:39,940 --> 00:19:42,820
But Otomo Middle School's defense is very tight.

410
00:19:42,820 --> 00:19:45,580
You can't pass us with this strength!

411
00:19:45,580 --> 00:19:48,990
Damn it! If we can't pass them, we can't score!

412
00:19:48,990 --> 00:19:50,410
We won't allow it!

413
00:19:50,410 --> 00:19:51,250
To the opposite wing!

414
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:55,760
Tsubasa-kun, who has been marking Nitta-kun until now...

415
00:19:55,760 --> 00:19:57,760
...finally joins the attack!

416
00:19:57,760 --> 00:19:59,680
At this fateful moment...

417
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:01,510
...you really did appear.

418
00:20:03,510 --> 00:20:04,470
Tsubasa!

419
00:20:04,470 --> 00:20:06,220
To the opposite wing!

420
00:20:06,220 --> 00:20:07,210
Oh no!

421
00:20:07,210 --> 00:20:10,600
This time the Otomo Quartet runs to stop Tsubasa-kun!

422
00:20:11,730 --> 00:20:14,990
The Otomo Quartet is truly strong.

423
00:20:14,990 --> 00:20:16,750
They have very good technique.

424
00:20:16,750 --> 00:20:18,980
If the ball hits the ground, I won't be able to shoot.

425
00:20:18,980 --> 00:20:21,280
I have no other choice!

426
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:22,500
What?!

427
00:20:22,500 --> 00:20:23,950
Could it be, Tsubasa--

428
00:20:23,950 --> 00:20:27,380
Direct Volley Shot Without Falling!

429
00:20:27,380 --> 00:20:30,000
It goes like a bullet!

430
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:30,750
Ichijo!

431
00:20:32,580 --> 00:20:34,220
Goal!

432
00:20:34,220 --> 00:20:35,600
From the right corner!

433
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:41,300
With amazing control, Tsubasa-kun sends the ball exactly where he wants it!

434
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:44,800
In the 29th minute of the first half, Nankatsu scores!

435
00:20:44,800 --> 00:20:47,050
That's it! I scored the first goal!

436
00:20:47,050 --> 00:20:51,040
Hooray! We're one step closer to victory!

437
00:20:51,040 --> 00:20:54,020
The Nankatsu Middle School Cheer Squad goes wild with this goal!

438
00:20:54,020 --> 00:20:58,320
An amazing long volley without dropping from Tsubasa-kun!

439
00:20:58,320 --> 00:21:02,010
This is the first goal Otomo Middle School has conceded in the tournament.

440
00:21:02,010 --> 00:21:02,820
Damn it!

441
00:21:04,300 --> 00:21:06,450
And the whistle blows to end the first half!

442
00:21:07,060 --> 00:21:10,680
The regional tournament final takes a break with last year's champion Nankatsu...

443
00:21:10,680 --> 00:21:13,460
...leading by one goal against Otomo Middle School.

444
00:21:13,460 --> 00:21:16,620
Isn't Ozora Tsubasa very good?

445
00:21:16,620 --> 00:21:19,420
Hitting that ball in the air...

446
00:21:19,420 --> 00:21:23,190
I'm sure even the goalkeeper didn't predict that shot was coming.

447
00:21:23,190 --> 00:21:25,020
I'm taking notes right away.

448
00:21:25,020 --> 00:21:25,970
Yes.

449
00:21:25,970 --> 00:21:30,470
A carefully made decision considering the remaining time.

450
00:21:30,470 --> 00:21:34,260
Even if it hadn't been a goal, the first half would have ended.

451
00:21:34,260 --> 00:21:37,980
He cleverly used the only moment Nitta could be left free.

452
00:21:38,670 --> 00:21:41,860
What can I say except "That's to be expected from Tsubasa"?

453
00:21:41,860 --> 00:21:45,860
Damn it! Tsubasa beat us single-handedly!

454
00:21:45,900 --> 00:21:51,060
However, marking only Tsubasa is the hardest thing.

455
00:21:51,440 --> 00:21:55,580
But we trained very hard to beat Tsubasa!

456
00:21:55,580 --> 00:21:57,960
We can't let it end like this.

457
00:21:57,960 --> 00:22:00,460
We'll definitely turn it around in the second half!

458
00:22:02,590 --> 00:22:04,490
This is absurd.

459
00:22:04,490 --> 00:22:11,010
How did he score that goal from such a distance by hitting that long pass without letting it fall?

460
00:22:11,600 --> 00:22:14,920
But he couldn't score any other goal besides that time.

461
00:22:14,920 --> 00:22:16,430
Then to win...

462
00:22:38,830 --> 00:22:44,710
chotto aremi na eesu ga tooru

463
00:22:38,830 --> 00:22:44,710
A star passes by with a stern look

464
00:22:44,710 --> 00:22:50,720
suguremono da to machijuu sawagu

465
00:22:44,710 --> 00:22:50,720
The whole town is buzzing that he's a remarkable person

466
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:56,730
chochou sanba, jiguzagu sanba

467
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:56,730
Butterfly samba, zigzag samba

468
00:22:56,730 --> 00:23:02,860
aitsu no uwasa de chanba mo hashiru

469
00:22:56,730 --> 00:23:02,860
The rumors about him even make the samba run

470
00:23:02,860 --> 00:23:08,950
sore ni tsukete mo oretacha nan darou

471
00:23:02,860 --> 00:23:08,950
And as for us, what are we doing here?

472
00:23:08,950 --> 00:23:15,040
booru hitotsu ni kirikiri mai sa

473
00:23:08,950 --> 00:23:15,040
Going crazy over just one ball

474
00:23:15,040 --> 00:23:18,190
dasshu dasshu dasshu

475
00:23:15,040 --> 00:23:18,190
Dash, dash, dash

476
00:23:18,190 --> 00:23:21,080
kikku enddo dasshu

477
00:23:18,190 --> 00:23:21,080
Kick and dash

478
00:23:21,080 --> 00:23:26,090
itsuka kimeru ze, inazuma shuuto

479
00:23:21,080 --> 00:23:26,090
Someday we'll nail it, a lightning shot

480
00:23:27,550 --> 00:23:33,260
son toki ore ga suupaa hiiroo sa

481
00:23:27,550 --> 00:23:33,260
At that moment, I'll be a super hero

482
00:23:33,260 --> 00:23:36,180
dasshu dasshu dasshu

483
00:23:33,260 --> 00:23:36,180
Dash, dash, dash

484
00:23:36,180 --> 00:23:39,140
kikku enddo dasshu

485
00:23:36,180 --> 00:23:39,140
Kick and dash

486
00:23:39,140 --> 00:23:45,690
moete seishun kakenukero

487
00:23:39,140 --> 00:23:45,690
Blaze with youth and run through

488
00:23:49,990 --> 00:24:00,630
Next Episode 31:
Hawk vs Tsubasa